raygui for generated9

Install libraylib, then build:

    cd /sys/src/libraygui
    mk install

Include u.h, libc.h, raylib.h and raygui.h; compile with -p. The header
selects libraygui.a. Do not define RAYGUI_IMPLEMENTATION in clients.
See raygui(2) for control ownership and an example; modelview(1) uses it.

Tests need a rio window with VirGL:

    cd /sys/src/libraygui/test
    mk test

They check drawing, queued UTF-8 input, text capacity, clipboard insertion
and color pickers. Tested on amd64/QEMU VirGL; raylib's limits apply.
See UPSTREAM and LICENSE for sources, adaptations and notices.
